window.products.push({"id":363180,"name":"Baking & Beyond Premium 24 Mini Cup Silicone Muffin Pan and Cupcake Pans w/Spatula- 24 Cups Muffins Tray, Cupcakes Pan | Silicone Muffin Molds, Non St","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718lZ9aNQeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Introducing a Better Baking Experience! We are Baker's at Heart Baking & Beyond is an American brand company and our mission is to bring a smile back to each baker that buys our products. As bakers ourselves we know what is most important to our customers. Taking a Stand for Every Home Baker We boldly stand up in the face of inferior products, made from flimsy materials, destined to disappoint. We firmly shout “you deserve a better baking experience.” Tested for Quality Our heavy duty 240 gram pans receive a thorough testing by our baker team members to ensure they withstand to our high standards. We ensure that every customer is satisfied.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718lZ9aNQeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BB BAKING & BEYOND","source_asin":"B07R9T55JZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-363180","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07R9T55JZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07R9T55JZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":363181,"name":"WUCHT Adult Weighted Blanket (60\"x80\", 15 lbs) for Individual Between 130-180 lbs, Grey Cotton Heavy Blanket Filled with Glass Beads","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51AwDuFWfYL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"FINAL 13 LEFT. Weighted blanket can offer a deep, healthy and restful sleep by simulating a feeling of warm hug. It's a great gift for people who want to get a good night's sleep and a refreshed feeling each morning! We use high quality materials to ensure our weighted blankets are harmless. Surface fabric is made of 100% natural cotton. Filled with hypo-allergenic, non-toxic, odorless glass beads and soft polyester fiberfill inserts. Durable threads and CNC sewing technology ensure the small pinholes and tight needle spacing to prevent glass beads leakage. Multiple compartments make glass beads evenly distributed and restrict the movement of glass beads to reduce noise. We guaruntee items can be returned without questions within 30 days of receipt of shipment. If you have any questions, please contact us and we will reply to you within 24 hours. It is recommended to choose the blanket weights 7%~12% of your body weight. Pregnant women, babies and sick patients are prohibited to use. Make sure children,seniors and physically weak people can remove the blanket themselves.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51AwDuFWfYL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WUCHT","source_asin":"B07G9HD7K5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-363181","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07G9HD7K5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07G9HD7K5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":363182,"name":"BAMBU Bowl Mini Naked, 1 EA","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pJ9cMr53L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Bambu at home. A distinctive range of contemporary products for the kitchen and home made from renewable materials. Bambu products are created with imagination and integrity and are intended to be used and enjoyed everyday. Our designs celebrate form, color and texture using low impact materials and processes. The products are tested and approved for food safety and all packaging material is made from certified sources, 100-percent recycled fiber or is recyclable. It's design with the planet in mind. Bambu provides design solutions made from renewable materials that excite and delight with sustainable alternatives for modern living. We strive to reduce the impact we place on the earth's resources and take a socially responsible approach to our products, processes and practices. We believe it is not just about the end product but about the entre process. Not just about what you make, but about how you make it and under what conditions. And it's not just about your beliefs, but instead about your social and environmental actions. Marrying modern designs and colors with traditional bamboo craftsmanship, the Bambu lacquerware collection is an innovative and contemporary range of bowls, plates and other tabletop items. Each piece is hand coiled with small strips of bamboo, shaped and finished with food-safe natural lacquer creating a beautiful, durable waterproof finish accented in modern colors. Our bowls are coiled by families in rural villages to help supplement farming income. The skill of coiling and carving bamboo bowls is a centuries-old craft unique to Vietnam.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pJ9cMr53L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bambu","source_asin":"B000HLXYQY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-363182","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000HLXYQY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000HLXYQY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
