window.products.push({"id":363190,"name":"BUTA 100PCS Air Fryer Disposable Paper Liners, 7.9in Unbleached Round Non-stick Parchment Paper sheets, Oil Resistant, Waterproof, Food Grade Baking p","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.56,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81an8nFdlkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Buta Air Fryer disposable round paper liners, 100 pcs, 7.9 inches Non-stick, waterproof and oil resistant; no need to wash air fryer; paper parchment made from wood pulp. Easy Clean-up You no longer have to worry about cleaning up after using your air fryer. With these round paper liners, you can simply throw them away after use. Each liner is 100 pcs, 7.9 inches, non-sticky, waterproof and oil resistant, so you don't have to worry about them sticking to the inside of the air fryer. Made from wood pulp, these paper liners give you the convenience of an easy clean up in no time. They have been designed to make your life simpler and easier, allowing you to spend more time enjoying your meals and less time worrying about the mess. Healthy Cooking Cooking with health in mind is always a priority. With these paper liners, you can rest assured that your food will not be exposed to any potentially harmful chemicals. This makes them an ideal choice for those who are looking for a healthier cooking option. The paper liners are also incredibly versatile, providing a safe cooking surface for a variety of dishes. From baking to air frying, these liners make for an easy and worry-free cooking experience. Enjoy your meals knowing you have chosen the healthiest option available. Durable & Heat Resistant When it comes to cooking with an air fryer, you need a liner that can keep up with the heat. That's why these upgraded paper liners are 1.5 times thicker than other paper liners, with 40gsm specification, providing greater durability and protection against high temperatures. With increased durability, you can cook with confidence knowing your air fryer paper liners won't let you down. This is especially useful for crisping up food and recipes that require higher temperatures to cook. Multipurpose The parchment paper sheet can be applied for baking, frying, roasting and grilling, or serving food. Suitable for home air fryer, microwave, steamer, oven, pan and etc. Perfect solution for a camping, BBQ parties, picnics and so on, lightweight and practical. Air Fryer Paper Liner Size:  Please allow small tolerances in item size Bottom Diameter: 7.9 inches (fits 3-8 QT) Upper Diameter: 8.3 inches  Height: 1.8 inches ⚠️CAUTION:  1. Do not use paper liners during preheating.  2. Place enough food into air fryer paper to avoid the hot air to blow it up. It may cause a paper to burn from heater of air fryer device.  3. Keep air fryer paper away from direct contact with the fire source  4. Please pay attention dimensions before purchasing the product to make sure it is a size you need. Package Includes:  100 PCS Round Air Fryer Disposable Paper Liner","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81an8nFdlkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BUTA","source_asin":"B0BLBDNHSH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-363190","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BLBDNHSH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BLBDNHSH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
