window.products.push({"id":363278,"name":"GRIDART PHOTO DISPLAY","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81G6wq6d-FL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Smartphones have made it easy to capture your fondest memories instantly by snapping a photo wherever you go and social media has made sharing those beautiful moments with others effortless. Unfortunately, with so many memories being captured and shared every day, it’s far too easy for your favorites to get forgotten and lost in the digital abyss. Introducing Gridart by Umbra Part ways from the pixels and bring your favourite images to life by taking them from the screen to the walls in your home, office or dorm room with Gridart, the photo collage frame from Umbra. With the Gridart 4x4 picture frame you can showcase 16 individual 4 x 4 inch (10 x 10cm) photos in a modern, gallery-style way. Use Gridart to feature memorable images from a vacation, wedding, graduation, family photoshoot, or other event or occasion that will stay with you long after you switch off your screen. Gridart is perfect for showcasing selfies and other photos from your favourite social media sites but that’s just the start. Get inspired and let your creativity run wild by combining pictures with graphic text, illustrations, drawings, sketches, patterns and other unique art to create your own one-of-a-kind, DIY collage frame that is sure to impress. Available in 3 attractive wood finishes, Gridart is beautiful to look at and will be a welcome addition to your home décor. At the same time, it’s practical design features a single glass lens and a solid backing which allows you to clean and change your images easily. To place your photos, use the existing face paper as a guide. Simply secure your own photos on top of the face paper using clear tape and you’re ready to go. Plus, Gridart comes with 2 sawtooth hangers pre-mounted to the frame so hanging it is also a breeze. Gridart is an unforgettable way to commemorate your favourite moments while at the same time adding a decorative touch to your home, office, community space, or dorm room. Measurements: 17 x 17 x 1 ¼ inches (43.2 x 43.2 x 3.2 cm) | Color: Walnut","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81G6wq6d-FL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Umbra","source_asin":"B00O333UE8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-363278","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00O333UE8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00O333UE8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
