window.products.push({"id":363301,"name":"Sink Splash Guard, Splash Guard for Sink Faucet, Kitchen Faucet Absorbent Mat, Reusable Microfiber Sink Mat, Super Absorbent Fast Drying Mat Sink Gadg","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61sk9gHj3bL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ATTENTION: Due to the saturation of diatom soil absorption, it is replaced every two days to ensure good utilization effects.<br>Release your hand: Still always wiping countertops after using the faucet? With our Sink Splash Guard, no need to wipe the sink countertops every time after using the faucet. No worry about the smell of the sink anymore, make your sink clean and neat, which can also protect the countertop from scratches, offering you a comfortable using experience. Suitable for most: Our reusable microfiber sink mat measures approx,14.8 x 5.4 inches, and the diameter is about 2.5 inches, appropriate size can be applied to most of the faucets. Of course, you can also cut the mat with scissors to get a size that matches your faucet. Absorbent Material: Unlike other mats, this dish drying mat's surface is made of absorbent artificial leather. The bottom is made of rubber, which can effectively prevent water from leaking from the bottom. The interior adopts diatom mud and rubber composite material, which can efficiently absorb the drip or splash water and quickly volatilize. Easy to install: You just need to spread it out and surround the faucet with the hole in the middle. It helps to absorb splash water while doing dishes, washing hands, washing vegetables or fruit, etc, prevent water stains on kitchen countertops from the faucet splashing or leaking. Always keep the sink area clean and dry. Multi Scene: These practical absorbent drying mats have a wide range of applications, are essential accessories for many places including your kitchen, bathroom, office, apartment, and more, meeting your various needs, it can also be applied in restaurants, cafes, and hotels and more.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61sk9gHj3bL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AUIAU","source_asin":"B09V4LXL7N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-363301","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09V4LXL7N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09V4LXL7N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
