window.products.push({"id":363312,"name":"Zelite Infinity Japanese Paring Knife 2.75 Inch, Paring Knives, Pairing Knife Kitchen, Fruit Knife, Small Knife - Japanese AUS-8 High Carbon Stainless","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91PEFbL8dYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅ PRECISION HANDLING: Imagine yourself taking out this professional Tourne paring knife to slice fruit for your guests’ drinks. Or peel vegetables and cut garnishings for the great meal you're preparing. This classic peeling knife is lighter than most and offers superior precision cutting. It's a stand out in any kitchen. ✅ PREMIUM JAPANESE STEEL, LEATHER SHEATH: The forged Japanese AUS8 high-carbon stainless steel blade has a Rockwell Hardness of (HRC 59±1). It has long-lasting edge retention and is stain, rust and corrosion resistant. So easy maintenance! Includes a protective leather guard to preserve your high-quality blade for years of use. ✅ CONTEMPORARY TRIPLE RIVETED BLACK PAKKAWOOD HANDLE: The ergonomic, full tang, black Pakkawood handle offers added strength, durability and control. This Japanese style knife has a tapered bolster and offers excellent comfort and balance. The Zelite Infinity 15-piece luxury silver mosaic rivet adds style and elegance. ✅ UNMATCHED AGILITY AND PERFORMANCE: The blade is hand finished using the traditional 3-step Honbazuke method. It has an incredible 12-15° razor sharp edge per side with a mirror polished cutting angle. This multi-purpose knife offers the ultimate blend of agility, efficiency and performance. ✅ ZELITE LIFETIME WARRANTY: Our chef knives come with perfection in mind. We provide a lifetime warranty against materials and/or manufacturing defects. Only if purchased from ‘Zelite Infinity’ – check item is “sold by Zelite-Infinity”. Try it risk free!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91PEFbL8dYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zelite Infinity","source_asin":"B0BL7GFM2M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-363312","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BL7GFM2M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BL7GFM2M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
