window.products.push({"id":363338,"name":"100% Egyptian Cotton Sheets for Queen Size Bed, 400 Thread Count Long Staple Cotton, Sateen Cooling Sheets Queen, 15 Inch Deep Pocket Queen Sheets Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":53.54,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51GHUn6OAsL._AC_SL1330_.jpg","description":"BREATHABLE COOLING SHEETS provided by using specially compacted yarns made from 100% Long Staple Cotton. The Long Staple Cotton Lightweight Queen Size Sheets Set are Sweat Wicking and Temperature Balancing to keep you cool during summer and warm during winters. These forever Fresh Feeling Real Cotton Bed Sheets are distinctively Soft, Durable and Smooth Sheets. PERFECT QUEEN FITTED SHEETS: Cotton Deep Pocket Fitted Sheets with specially patented stitching pattern using thick high quality all around elastic are tight fitting. They fit mattresses from 8” to 15” thick. Cotton Top Sheets Queen Size: 90” x 102”; Fully Elasticized Fitted sheet with deep pockets: 60” x 80” + 15”; 2 Standard Pillowcases: 20” x 30”. The Queen Size Flat sheets & Standard Pillowcases have a stylish 4 inch Hem detailing for the Elegant and Luxurious look. SAFE & ECO-FRIENDLY: These Sensitive Skin Light Blue Bed Sheets are Individually Tailored, Measured and Quality Checked (piece by piece). Our Chemical free sheets set is made in BSCI compliant and OEKO-TEX Standard 100 factory, an independent certification system that ensures to meet high safety standard to keep your family safe and healthy. The Oeko tex sheets are tested for harmful substances and certified AZO FREE, making it soothing for even the most sensitive skin. GUARANTEE. OUR 100% Cotton Sheets. We specialize in manufacturing some of the softest and most luxurious cotton Sheets in the industry. And that includes our top of the line products - our Egyptian cotton Sheets. A genuine 400 thread count Sheet Set crafted from the finest Egyptian cotton yarns. No misleading Title or Description. Unbeatable prices AUTHENTICATED 400 THREAD COUNT FABRIC: These Cooling Sheets are soft. They have the everlasting comfort of Luxury 5 Star Hotel Sheets at an AFFORDABLE price. These 400TC extra deep pocket sheets are EASY CARE AND MAINTENANCE – Made from Fade Resistant Dyes, the best quality cotton sheets stay bright even after extended use. Machine wash cold on gentle cycle, tumble dry low... But use of bleach or creams containing bleaching agent may cause color loss. 100% SATISFACTION GUARANTEE - Our products are backed by incredible customer service to make sure your satisfaction is guaranteed. If for any reason you don't love our bedsheets, you can return them within 30 days for a full refund as per Amazon guidelines. Our high-quality designs match any decor and make the ultimate gift idea for men and women, Moms and Dads, Valentine's - Mother's - Father's Day and Christmas. Best for any room in your house - bedroom, guest, kids room, vacation home.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51GHUn6OAsL._AC_SL1330_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Shreem Linen","source_asin":"B07YBXQBBM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-363338","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YBXQBBM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YBXQBBM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
