window.products.push({"id":363340,"name":"VEEYOO King Duvet Cover Cotton - 100% Washed Cotton Duvet Cover Set with Zipper Closure, Extra Soft Breathable Comforter Cover (1 Charcoal Duvet Cover","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zzZ4AaZkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"1. MULTIPLE COLORS: Duvet cover cotton is available in 10 gorgeous solid colors to give your bedroom a style refresh. With colors ranging anywhere from neutral to vibrant, you're sure to find a swatch that matches your bedroom's color scheme. 2. NATURAL COTTON: 100% washed cotton duvet cover set is super soft, cozy, and moisture-wicking. The king duvet cover allows plenty of airflow during the summer but is definitely cozy enough to stand up to the cold as well. Provide comfort and coziness in all weather. 3. SECURITY CLOSURE: A hidden zipper with four corner ties seamlessly keeps the duvet insert stay in place throughout the night, no matter how much you may toss and turn. Zipper closure is easy and convenient for you to switch up at your leisure. 4. PACKAGE INCLUDE: King duvet cover set includes one duvet cover 90x104\" and two matching pillow shams 20x36\". NOT INCLUDE A DUVET INSERT. It will perfectly tie together your new bedding, such as king size duvet insert, comforter, or weighted blanket. 5 EASY CARE: Care for this cotton duvet cover is as simple as tossing it in the wash with other items of the same color and tumble-drying on low. Pls, notice that this material with a natural slight wrinkle. It can be steamed or ironed to remove wrinkles if you do not like it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zzZ4AaZkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VEEYOO","source_asin":"B0BVVZWBMG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-363340","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BVVZWBMG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BVVZWBMG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":363341,"name":"Flash Furniture Whitney Massaging Multi-Position Recliner with Side Pocket and Ottoman in Black LeatherSoft","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":301.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Xc0VYbg9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"If you are looking for a recliner with a modern and classy look that is also comfortable and therapeutic, your search is over! Enjoy a relaxing massage in the comfort of your own home or office with this black recliner and ottoman set featuring a swivel seat and lever adjusting recline with infinite adjustments. Beautifully designed with soft and durable LeatherSoft upholstery, this recliner is soft to the touch and exceptionally comfortable. This set offers maximum massaging power that massages your back, lumbar area and thighs. With three intensity levels and five massage modes you are sure to get the comfort that you're looking for. Take care of any spills with a water-based cleaner. Look no further for your perfect massage chair offered at an incredible price!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Xc0VYbg9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Flash Furniture","source_asin":"B00S0QPC5Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-363341","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00S0QPC5Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00S0QPC5Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
