window.products.push({"id":363542,"name":"Prepworks by Progressive Collapsible Over-The-Sink Dish Drainer","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/611z2XNhbeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Reclaim counter space in your kitchen with this innovatively designed collapsible dish rack from Progressive International, which conveniently fits over your sink. A great choice for small apartment kitchens, this compact dish drainer collapses down to two-thirds of its original height for easy storage in a cabinet or under the sink when you're finished. It features patented self-supporting arms that extend from 16-1/2 to 26-3/4 inches. The drainer will hold up to 8 plates measuring up to 10 inches in diameter, and it also offers a removable silverware tray. It measures 16-1/2 by 12-1/4 by 1-1/2 inches (LxWxH) when stored, and it expands to 6 inches in height when in use. Made of polypropylene and TPE, it's dishwasher safe for easy cleaning. Arms extend to fit most kitchen sinks. Collapses to two-thirds of its original height. About Progressive International After 38 years in business, Progressive International is still dedicated to creating functional gadgets, tools, food-prep items and household products to make your cooking and meal preparation more efficient and fun. Located in Kent, Washington, Progressive's products are sold in the United States, Canada, Europe, South America, and other international markets. Progressive Makes Cooking Cool More than a workspace, the contemporary kitchen is the heart of the home where we connect with family and friends, and Progressive's philosophy of product design aims to create the perfect balance of form, function and value for your kitchen. The design process pulls from many different research methods such as ethnographic research, consumer testing, surveys, and in-home observations, identifying real life problems in the kitchen that translate to fresh, new ideas for smarter products.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/611z2XNhbeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Progressive International","source_asin":"B002R5A178","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-363542","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B002R5A178","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B002R5A178","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":363543,"name":"Poise3EHome Red Sequin Chair Sashes Folding Chair Covers Bow for Wedding Party Reception Decorations, 20 PCS","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.89,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71AZXTXQbgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Sequin ❤Texture: The chair sashes are made of sequin fabric (3mm round sparkling sequins embroidered on fabric), which was solid and durable, the sequins are not easy to fall off. The backside is made into a bow shape, so it have a good decorative effect and practicality. ❤Size: 14 inches length with 6 inches width. The material can be stretched, suitable for chair back width: 13 to 14.5 inches. ❤Luxury- glitter sparkle shiny decorative sequins, help to create a happy atmosphere. ❤Perfect for: Wedding, reception, party decorations, festival decor, home decor, banquet, baby shower, birthday, Christmas, Thanksgiving. ❤Shipping: Usually it was fulfillment by Amazon, takes 2-3 days. If the Amazon warehouse is out of stock, we'll send it from our warehouse, which usually takes about 7-10 days.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71AZXTXQbgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Poise3EHome","source_asin":"B08MPRP5B4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-363543","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08MPRP5B4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08MPRP5B4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
