window.products.push({"id":363552,"name":"Wax and Wick 12oz. Pure Soy Wax Scented Candle with Double Wood Wick - White, Espresso Scent - Notes of Dark Roasted Coffee and Chocolate","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":35.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JSZkRwGPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Candle That Appeals to Both Sexes... And Multiple Senses Tired of candles that smell like a perfume shop? Try our unique Soy Wax Candles. Our candles give off a clean, woodsy scent, with spicy, fragrant notes of amber, cream, vanilla, musk & sandalwood. Cozy & warm, it sets a comforting mood that appeals to both men & women. Plus, it's natural & eco-friendly. Forget candles made with paraffin blends, which can generate messy soot. Our Espresso Soy Candles contain ONLY pure soy wax... FREE of dyes, phthalates & toxins. So, it burns: *CLEANLY with no soot at all *SLOWLY... up to 60 hours (up to 3-hour sessions) 2 FSC-Certified Wood Wicks Create a Brighter Glow One wick crackles; the other doesn't. So, you get the best of both: the evocative sounds of a real wood fire PLUS a more even burn. Plus, with its sparkling glass jar & die-cut label, your Candle complements any decor, from rustic to classic to contemporary. Set it in a bedroom or bath and let its calming scents permeate the atmosphere. Ideal for the great room, dining room & \"man cave,\" too. All-American Craftsmanship, Guaranteed Sourced from US materials, your Candle is handmade right here in USA. Plus, it's backed by our great guarantee: If you don't love your candle, just return it (unused) within 30 days of delivery... and we will gladly refund or replace it. Add to Cart Now Stock up for your entire gift list. Perfect holiday, wedding, & housewarming present!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JSZkRwGPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wax & Wick","source_asin":"B01N9E19V7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-363552","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01N9E19V7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01N9E19V7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":363553,"name":"Star Wars Lightsaber Duel Twin Comforter and Sheet Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51E67QAQ6TL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description The saga continues and May 19, 2005 will bring a new milestone when Episode III, The Revenge of The Sith, the final chapter in the movie series, is released. As the last piece of the puzzle, Episode III will answer the key question that have lingered for 28 years and one in particular that towers above all. How did Darth Vader, the greatest screen villain of all time come to be? In the Light Saber Duel bedding, the comforter has a silhouetted image of a lightsaber duel between Obi Wan and Anakin before Anakin transforms into Darth Vader. It is a blue, aqua and black color scheme and also incorporates badge design elements on the sheeting. Amazon.com It's time to refresh those threadbare Star Wars -themed linens purchased sometime circa the release of the original movie. Old-school collectors and young fans alike will want to decorate their bedrooms with this comforter and sheet set, which bear a fresh design in honor of the May 2005 release of the third and final chapter in the Star Wars trilogy, Revenge of the Sith . Sized for a twin bed, the set includes a 62-by-86-inch comforter, one fitted sheet, one flat sheet, and a standard pillowcase. All bedding components are sewn from 70-percent polyester/30-percent cotton fabric and stuffed with polyester fill. On the main side of the comforter, the first and infamous lightsaber duel between Anakin Skywalker and Obi-Wan Kenobi is captured in a full-length image on a blue background, reminding young Jedi that one can never underestimate the power of the Force. The Star Wars logo in blue and white looms along the bottom while the comforter's side panels and reverse side are covered in blue fabric emblazoned with the word \"Jedi\" in turquoise blue lettering. The pillowcase features the same duel in turquoise and black silhouette on royal blue. Matching royal blue sheets are peppered with badge-style emblems of a Jedi Starfighters, the Jedi logo, and a lightsaber shield. A whole host of matching bedroom components, from pillows to curtains, is available to deck out the entire bedroom in tribute to the Jedi masters. All bedding is machine-washable and dryer-safe. --Cristina Vaamonde","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51E67QAQ6TL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"STAR WARS","source_asin":"B0007OES66","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-363553","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0007OES66","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0007OES66","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
