window.products.push({"id":363564,"name":"Exportindia Jaipuri Quilt Block Floral Print Quilt Rajai Blanket Home Decor Quilt Ultra Warm Soft Quilt (King /Queen Size 90x108 Inch)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":99.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91MotTto2jL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"★DESCRIPTION:- This is Special Unique Hand Block Printed Quilt, Jaipuri Rajai.My units member made this special quilt.The entire quilt is made inside i used 100% pure natural doctor cotton filling.This is hand block print is famous of Jaipur rajasthan. cotton quality is cotton voil.Quilt is very soft and warm.These cotton light weight quilt with a beautiful color and design can be used.Used both sides (Reversible). ★PURE COTTON JAIPURI RAZAI QUILT:- Hand Printed with the age old slow process of carved wood block printing, our Jaipuri Razai is stuffed with export quality cotton. The outer layer fabric is pure cotton voile, which is breathable, soft, and snugly. Once you get in, it will be really difficult for you to come out of it. ★HAND BLOCK PRINTED RAZAI:- Hand blocking is one of the specialties of Jaipuri Razai. Hand blocking is a centuries-old technique used in Rajasthan. Wooden blocks are cut out in multiple shapes and unique designs are carved onto them. Then these blocks are dipped in color and pressed onto the cloth repeatedly. ★DYNAMIC TRADITIONAL MOTIFS:- The designs and embroidery you find on these quilts are also unique. There are various kinds of prints that Rae famous and sought after when it comes to Jaipuri Razai, includes, Jaipuri print, Hand-Block Print, Gold Print, and Hand Stitched and Quilted. ★PRODUCT FEATURES:- Hand-Stitching by the Local Artisans. Hand-Stitching by the Local Artisans. Cotton Voile Spreading. Cotton Voile Spreading. Hand Printing and Block printing. Hand Printing and Block printing. Jaipuri Quilts are made from 100% cotton. Jaipuri Quilts are made from 100% cotton. Super soft and cozy. Super soft and cozy. ★WASHING INSTRUCTION (WASHALE):- Jaipuri Razai / quilts are washable. Wash your quilt in the hand wash cycle. The entire quilt is made inside i used 100% pure natural doctor cotton filling. ★Package Content:- 1* 100%Pure Cotton Traditional Jaipuri Razai Quilt","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91MotTto2jL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Exportindia","source_asin":"B09D3VB4VP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-363564","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09D3VB4VP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09D3VB4VP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
