window.products.push({"id":363648,"name":"Rastal Teku 3.0 Tulip Craft Beer Glasses - the Original, Non-Nucleated, Glass for Tasting Beer, Italian Made, 14.2ounce, Set of 6 Pack","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":67.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61sR9u8rUJL._AC_SL1444_.jpg","description":"Beer enthusiasts wishing to stimulate their guests enthusiasm for craft or gourmet beers should remember two rules for success. First: the eye wants to be pleased, too. Second: only a perfectly shaped glass will bring out the full array of aromas and flavors locked in craft beers. The pairing of a beer style with a particular glass can be performed with meticulous attention to detail, as can be observed in many Belgian pubs where each brand and each beer has its own exclusive glass. An attractive and attention-grabbing solution, no doubt. However, the wider and more varying the range of beer styles offered, the greater the ongoing effort and investment in glassware. This is where the TEKU goblet and the craft beer glass range by RASTAL come into play: they offer excellent alternatives for any beer style and environment.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61sR9u8rUJL._AC_SL1444_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rastal","source_asin":"B01IAFUG8M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-363648","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01IAFUG8M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01IAFUG8M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":363649,"name":"Protecu Chocolate Bomb Mold - 6-Cavity Hot Chocolate Molds for Baking & Silicone Semi Sphere Chocolate Molds for for Making Chocolate Cake Cookie Cand","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711RK96t3XL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Super cute and fun to make SO many flavor variations of hot chocolate bombs with Protecu chocolate bomb mold!  It is amazing to make hot chocolate bomb, cocoa bomb, Jerry, Ice cube by this popular chocolate mold with families. Material:Silicone Style:6-Cavity Color: Brown What you need to make hot chocolate bombs?chocolate molds  hot cocoa mix  marshmallowsHow to make hot chocolate bombs with our hot chocolate bomb mold?1. Melt your chocolate. Use the microwave to melt the chocolate melts or chocolate stirring in between until everything is smooth and pourable. 2. Fill the molds. Scoop some chocolate into the hot chocolate bombs mold and use the back of a spoon or pastry brush to push the melted chocolate around the molds,  making it thick enough along the sides and edges. Pop the silicone chocolate molds into the freezer for 5-10 minutes to set.3. Remove the chocolate from silicone molds. Gently push the half spheres out of the silicone molds for chocolate.4. Melt the edges. Microwave a microwave-safe plate for a minute, you want the plate to be just hot enough to melt the chocolate. Pick up the empty half of the chocolate bomb and place it on the warm plate for a couple of seconds, just until it melts.5. Fill. Add 1 tablespoon hot cocoa powder and mini marshmallows (and any other add-ins you want) to half of the spheres. Pick up another half and melt the edge on the warm plate then push the two sides together to seal. 6. Decorate.Drizzle on some extra chocolate, decorate the hot cocoa bombs with crushed cookies, candy, or sprinkles!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711RK96t3XL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Protecu","source_asin":"B08Q7NMK74","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-363649","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08Q7NMK74","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08Q7NMK74","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
