window.products.push({"id":363653,"name":"Wool Coasters for Drinks Absorbent - Set of 4 Round Felt Coaster Pads - Handmade, Multicolor, Scratch Free, Thick & Durable Felt Coasters - Home & Kit","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61OE7t68AKL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"GORGEOUS WOOL COASTERS: These colourful felt ball coasters are guaranteed to bring brightness and beauty to any table, office or home. Each round coaster is around 4.5 - 5 inch in diameter. In packs of 4, each set of water absorbent coaster come in a natural flower pressed Lokta Paper Keepsake round box making them a great gift or a housewarming offering. HANDMADE WATER ABSORBENT COASTERS FOR DRINKS: Made of 100% Fair Trade, New Zealand imported wool of the finest quality, these each set of felt coasters are handmade by the creative and talented local artisans in Nepal. Each hand felted, sheep wool ball is naturally dyed (free of harmful chemicals), and then individually selected and woven together. Designed and created with love in the heart of the Himalayas by traditional Nepalese artisans. USAGE OF FELT BALL ROUND COASTERS: These multicolour wool coasters for drinks absorbent are fun and functional. Used to protect all surfaces, from damp or hot dishes, these unique and thoughtful gifts are a perfect solution for virtually every occasion. Ideal for kitchens, living rooms or dining rooms, they make perfect gift or unique accessory to any home. CONSCIOUS CONSUMERISM: Felt coasters for drinks absorbant is handmade with love and dedication from truly talented Nepalese artisans. Fair trade agreements are strictly followed, which means that with every purchase of our multicolor pompom coaster, you are not only promoting handmade, artisan craftsmanship, but you are also providing opportunities for and supporting incredibly underprivileged communities. WE CARE ABOUT YOUR SATISFACTION: Each Felt Ball Round Coasters Set is distinctly unique and made with love, dedication and a passion for preserving ancient cultural practice. We hope you will love them as much as we do. If the felt wool pom pom coaster is found defective, you can simply return the item within 30 days after delivery for a prompt replacement or refund. No restocking charges, no hassle!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61OE7t68AKL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ojas Yatra","source_asin":"B0BG85WDFT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-363653","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BG85WDFT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BG85WDFT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
