window.products.push({"id":363666,"name":"USMC Natural Stone Coaster- USMC Marine Corps Eagle-Stone (Set of 4)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":43.75,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hUq63z+LL._AC_SL1010_.jpg","description":"Our coaster sets feature the U.S. Marine Corps which was founded in 1775, the U.S. Marine Corps has one of the most grueling training regimens known to man, the Marine Corps is renowned for producing soldiers who exhibit the highest levels of physical strength and mental toughness. We show our pride for our soldier by producing the highest quality merchandise to showcase their achievements.  NATURAL STONE COASTERS: Sandstone is naturally absorbent material; our U.S. Marine Corps stone coasters are combined with a cork backing. Our cork backed marine coaster set will add an additional layer of protection to your furnishings and provide a stylish patriotic accent piece to your home or business.  GUARANTEED: 100% satisfaction guaranteed or your Money Back! If for any reason you are not satisfied with our marine stone coasters just return it for a full refund or a replacement on us. We know you will love our patriotic gifts merchandise as much as we do. Each decal on our coaster set is hand applied making sure our quality is impeccable.  GIFT IDEA: Our marine corps merchandise for men or women make the perfect gifts for any occasion: Christmas, Birthday Gifts, Wedding Party, Father?s Day, etc! Our marine beverage coasters are always appropriate to show your pride!  GREAT FOR ALL BEVERAGES: Our United States Marine coaster is sold as a set. Sit back, relax and enjoy your favorite beverage whether it be beer, wine or soda. Show your US Marine pride by using our natural stone coasters that are stylish, useful and affordable.  US MARINE CORPS: The Marines have lived up to their hard-won reputation as the ?First to Fight,? serving on the front lines of some of the most intense battles. This coaster set represents the tough fighting spirit and proud military tradition of the United States Marine Corps.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hUq63z+LL._AC_SL1010_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Erazor Bits","source_asin":"B01NGUCT6R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-363666","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01NGUCT6R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01NGUCT6R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
