window.products.push({"id":363668,"name":"Instylecraft - Set of 4 Marble Coasters with Brass Inlay - Decorative, & Perfect Protection - Perfect for Coffee Table and Home Decor - Coaster Set fo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":43.4,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+Y6kIC5aL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Elegant Look White marble gives these coasters a bright and stylish appearance. The simple design underlines the beauty of the durable stone and makes it an ideal gift for everyone. These coasters are made to protect your furniture and surfaces from drink stains and they make an elegant addition to your kitchen décor. Functional and Easy to Clean. The soft velvet at the bottom of each coaster sees to it that your furniture and surfaces are safe from scratches. How to Clean? You can mix a little soap into warm water in a spray bottle or simply put a few drops onto a wet cloth. Wipe the marble surface down with this sudsy cloth and follow immediately with a rinse and a dry. Be careful not to use too much soap, which may leave a film behind. Handcrafted of 100% natural marble. Practical and beautiful, these marble plattesr are just what your dining set is missing! Set the table with these statement platters, or stack in the centre for a contemporary look. Perfect Gift Set - This stunning set of 4 marble coasters makes the perfect gift housewarming, engagement, Christmas, Hanukkah, or wedding present. Durability & Functionality - Our coasters are made of high-quality materials, ensuring maximum durability and functionality. These coasters are designed to protect your furniture and keep your surfaces looking new! Eliminating annoying drips and spills. Beautifully Designed - Marble coasters come with a variety of designs and styles, making them the perfect accent piece for your kitchen decor. They are minimalistic and modern which can add a stylish touch to your home or office decors. Multifunctional - These coasters can be used for both hot and cold beverages, so you can enjoy a refreshing drink without worrying about damage to your furniture. It can also be used in a variety of places, such as on a coffee table, sideboard or dining table. Versatile & Easy to Clean - Coasters are easy to clean with just a dry cloth and can be used for all sorts of home decor and kitchen sets for home. Easily match the color and design with the rest of your home decor and furniture.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+Y6kIC5aL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"InstyleCraft","source_asin":"B09X5WVNMC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-363668","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09X5WVNMC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09X5WVNMC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
