window.products.push({"id":363688,"name":"Infrared Automatic Soap Dispenser, Electric Soap Dispenser, Stainless Steel Touchless Auto Hand Soap Dispenser for Bathroom Kitchen Hotel Restaurant. ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6176roAkl5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Sensor Soap Dispenser - Automatic soap dispenser uses the newly designed free-standing adjustable button with built-in precision infrared motion and PIR sensor detection technology. The upgraded sensor extends its life and sensitivity, so you can get a hands-free soap dispenser quickly. The package includes an ultra-soft wipe, and the complimentary funnel allows the soap to be poured into the soap dispenser. Adjustable capacity - The soap dispenser has a capacity of 285ml 9.56oz. The adjustable dispensing control soap volume controls the liquid volume from 0.5 to 3 ml by adjusting the + - switch. No dripping or smearing, no waste soap. Compatible with most liquids. High quality and durable materials - This soap dispenser is made of 304 fingerprint resistant stainless steel, and the enhanced motor power provides a more stable liquid production. The soap dispenser is equipped with Class 3A leak proof and waterproof technology to prevent soap or water from corroding the board. Waterproof and easy to use - You can avoid cross infection without touching the soap dispenser. The waterproof base and rubber seal design prevent the battery case from being immersed in water, causing corrosion and dispenser failure. In addition, the base is easy to separate without screws. 12 month - You can enjoy our 12 month warranty to get a replacement service. If you have any problems with the soap dispenser, please feel free to contact us and we will respond and process within 24 hours.Do not use too viscous hand sanitizer to avoid clogging and not working properly; if you do not use it for a long time, it is recommended to remove the battery to prevent the battery from corroding the battery contacts in the battery compartment.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6176roAkl5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OKJORW","source_asin":"B07YWQ4GK5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-363688","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YWQ4GK5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YWQ4GK5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
