window.products.push({"id":363794,"name":"Home Soft Things Derby Double Sided Faux Fur Throw Blanket, Citron, 50'' x 60'', Super Soft Comfy Fluffy Plush Bed Couch Cover for All Year Round Acce","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.31,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81FzoXTB5JL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"BOON Throw & Blanket Introduces The Derby Double Sided Faux Fur Throw. Our Derby Faux Fur is one of the softest throws on the market. This throw is made of ultra fine Faux Fur that will trap heat into the fibers so you stay nice and cozy, but light enough you won't overheat. The perfect throw to snuggle up in for a quick nap or to lounge under on those chilly nights. Available in a variety of colors, this throw is perfect as an accent in any room. A perfect gift for anyone! . Machine Wash Cold Separately On Low. Tumble Dry Low With Little To No Heat. Line Dry If Desired. DO NOT BLEACH","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81FzoXTB5JL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Home Soft Things","source_asin":"B07N99774M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-363794","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07N99774M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07N99774M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":363795,"name":"JoyJolt Tri-Insulated Wine Tumbler with Lid Pack. 12 oz Tumbler, Slider and Straw Lids. Vacuum Double Walled Stainless Steel Stemless Wine Glass, Copp","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81CX5yHmLRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"WHY STOP AT DOUBLE WALL? With JoyJolt Triple Insulated Wine Cups, cold drinks stay cold for longer - Our vacuum double insulated wine tumbler is already brag worthy for its thermal cooling, but we also infused this cute tumbler cup with copper so you have the coldest vino, even on the hottest day. 3PC SET – 2x TUMBLER LID! Each thermal wine tumbler comes with a Sippy Lid and Straw Lid! So you’ll always have the right lid for wine OR cocktails! And while the lids are not triple insulated they ARE suction sealed. Combined with the cup’s insulation, your wine will stay cold for many, many hours! PARTY BUS APPROVED SPLASH-PROOF: With their tight suction seal, these unbreakable wine glasses are perfect for times where spills are inevitable! Great as travel wine glass to stash in luggage, or a camping wine glass in the bottom of a heavy backpack. A portable wine glass for parties on the move! UNIVERSAL SIZE FOR ALL DRINKS! This 12oz tumbler cup is 3.5” wide at the narrow ends, 4” wide in the middle, and 4.3” tall. A large wine glass for champagne… and a small tumbler for tropical cocktails. And because they’re triple insulated, you have to try these frozen cocktail tumblers for margaritas! CORROSION RESISTANT AND BPA FREE: Your stainless steel wine glass has an AS lid which is free from BPA and Phthalates. And the 18/8 stainless steel body has been infused with chromium and nickel – both food safe metals that stop our fun wine glasses going rusty! Handwash only to protect vacuum seal. THE CUP OF THE YEAR! This powder coated tumbler comes in many colors including : blue, white, green, pink, black - and the on-trend Veri Peri Purple - Pantone Color of The Year! Your metal wine tumbler will be safely nestled in a gift box with a 12 Month Guarantee. So, grab yours now, from JoyJolt.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81CX5yHmLRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JoyJolt","source_asin":"B0BN72GRWZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-363795","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BN72GRWZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BN72GRWZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":363796,"name":"Mr. Heater Warmers-10 Pack Hand Warmer, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":5.39,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ebi5kC7oL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Mr. Heater brings you comfort – in their quality and the warmth their product provides. Mr. Heater disposable hand warmers are made of all natural ingredients that generate heat when exposed to air. The odorless pouch fits in the palm of your hand, gloves, or pockets. Their convenient size makes them the perfect travel companion for on the slopes, at the jobsite or shoveling your driveway. Experience the warmth and comfort only Mr. Heater can provide!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ebi5kC7oL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mr. Heater","source_asin":"B07DK53F1C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-363796","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07DK53F1C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07DK53F1C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":363797,"name":"FRUIT FRIEND Produce Preservers 3 pack - Keep Fruits & Vegetables Fresh For Longer - Safe Food Grade Silicone Storage Balls - Ethylene Gas Absorbing T","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81kBRtJfiNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Don’t You Love Fresh, Tasty, Delicious, Juicy Fruits And Vegetables? Isn’t It Frustrating How Quickly They Ripe And Rot? Well, Now You Can Prolong Your Groceries’ Life And Keep Them Fresh 3 Times Longer! All You Need Is This Produce Preservers Pack! Following a healthy, balanced diet and consuming fruits and vegetables is of paramount importance! However, groceries are very sensitive and keeping them fresh for long is impossible. Well, we have to inform you that you are wrong! Fruit Friend presents you with the ultimate fruits and vegetables preservation balls which are exactly what you need to keep food fresh. Highest Quality Food Grade Silicone And Special Ethylene Absorption Technology This amazing pack includes 3 Fruit Friend producer preserver balls. Each one about the size of a golf ball and last 3 months each. These fruits and vegetables preservers are made of USDA food grade silicone which is 100% safe. Each food saver includes a neutralizer packet. The proprietary blend of minerals and active ingredients, along with the advanced technology that eliminates the gases which make your produce ripen, will help you enjoy your groceries for longer! As a result, they will not rot, turning your refrigerator into a reeking mess. In addition, you will be able to save money as you will not have to visit the grocery store so often. Make A Good Deed We are committed to helping people make their lives easier! This is why we donate a neutralizer pack to a community or an organization in need, for every purchased preserver! Use yours at home, at the office, at restaurants or at schools and lend a helping hand at the same time. Click Add To Cart Now!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81kBRtJfiNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fruit Friend","source_asin":"B0120HOSEY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-363797","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0120HOSEY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0120HOSEY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
