window.products.push({"id":363811,"name":"Fluffy Plush Duvet Cover Set King Size, Luxury Ultra Soft Velvet Fuzzy Comforter Cover Bed Sets 4Pcs(1 Faux Fur Duvet Cover + 2 Pillow Cases + 1 Pillo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81pl318LPKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【LUXURY AND SOFT】 The front of the fluffy comforter cover is microfiber plush, which is super soft and comfortable. The back is silky velvet fabric that is delicate and skin-friendly, locking in warmth, gives you a warm and cosy sleep in the cold winter. 【WARM, COZY & STYLISH】 This fluffy bed set brings you the ultimate comfortable sleep experience, like sleeping on a cloud so you can fully relax in your bed. The stylish solid color design adds luxury to your room and is the perfect choice for updating your bathroom. It’s also a warm gift for your family, friends or colleagues, making them feel your caring. 【EASY TO INSTALL】 The faux fur comforter cover has a hidden zipper closure at the bottom, and the metal zipper is smooth and durable, easy to disassemble; The 4 corner ties inside the plush comforter cover helps keep the quilt in place and prevent slipping for comfortable sleeping at night. 【OPTIONAL SIZE】 The navy blue shaggy duvet cover set includes 1 x King size duvet cover (90\"x 104\"), 2 x Pillowcases (20\" x 36\"), and 1 x Throw pillow cover (18\" x 18\"). Note: Quilts and sheets are not included. This fluffy duvet cover set comes in a variety of colors and sizes so you can choose according to your preference and bedroom style. 【CARE INSTRUCTION】The comfortable fuzzy bedding set can be machine washable in cold water, gentle cycle, tumble dry low, do not bleach, do not iron. To protect the fur, turn it inside out when cleaning. We recommend cleaning before first use. Please feel free to contact us if you have any question, we will reply you within 24 hours and give you a satisfied answer.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81pl318LPKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BLEUM CADE","source_asin":"B0B4RD9GDP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-363811","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B4RD9GDP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B4RD9GDP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
